  only Horde
  zone Durotar
  tip Mine every Copper Vein and Poor Copper Vein you pass until Mining 65; Poor Copper Veins give Copper Ore and Rough Stone from skill 1. The Rough Stone is what Blacksmithing 1-50 eats, so keep all of it. Hold on to the Copper Ore too: smelted into Copper Bars it becomes your Bronze Bars at 75 and 125. Stop at Razor Hill to smelt.
