step Mithril and Truesilver in the Hinterlands
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip Run the same Hinterlands loop again up to Mining 245; Truesilver Deposits open at 230 and carry the Aquamarine and Star Ruby the Imperial Plate brackets will want. This band alone eats 276 Mithril Bars, so mine plenty of Mithril Ore and smelt it at a forge as you go.
